 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="line-height: 27pt; text-indent: 0cm; margin-left: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">联 系 人：张志波 丁思琪</span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="line-height: 27pt; text-indent: 0cm; margin-left: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">联系电话：<span lang="EN-US">029-81892377</span>，<span lang="EN-US">81891767</span></span></p>
 <p class="MsoListParagraph" style="line-height: 27pt; text-indent: -80pt; margin-left: 111.5pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">邮<span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>箱：<span lang="EN-US">zlglk@xidian.edu.cn</span></span></p>
 <p style="background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 30.4pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p style="background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 30.4pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">附件：<span lang="EN-US">1.2022</span>高等教育质量监测国家数据平台数据表格及内涵</span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">说明（含任务分工，请在教务处网站或微信群内下载）</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 60pt; margin-left: 10.5pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; line-height: 28pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">本科生院</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2022</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">年<span lang="EN-US">9</span>月<span lang="EN-US">19</span>日</span></p>
 <p>&nbsp;</p>
